      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(install-cli): track mktemp paths and clean up on EXIT",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`scripts/install-cli.sh` created temporary directories during Node user-space\ninstall (and temp files for pnpm workspace rewrites) without tracking them\nfor EXIT cleanup. On failure paths after `mktemp`, those paths leaked under\n`/tmp`.\n\n## Evidence\n\nForced failure on the **production** `install_node` path from the patched\ninstaller (source with `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_CLI_SH_NO_RUN=1`, override\n`linked_node_is_usable` to force download, stub `download_file` to call\ninstaller `fail()` after `TMPFILES` registration).\n\n```console\n$ OPENCLAW_INSTALL_CLI_SH_NO_RUN=1 source ./scripts/install-cli.sh\n$ linked_node_is_usable() { return 1; }\n$ download_file() { ...; fail \"forced failure inside install_node after temp registration (proof)\"; }\n$ install_node\nInstalling Node 22.22.0 (user-space)...\ndownload_file_called dest=/var/folders/.../T/tmp.flGv1x44Y5/SHASUMS256.txt\nTMPFILES_at_download=/var/folders/.../T/tmp.flGv1x44Y5\nregistered_temp=/var/folders/.../T/tmp.flGv1x44Y5\nexists_before_fail=yes\nERROR: forced failure inside install_node after temp registration (proof)\nAFTER_RESULT=CLEANED /var/folders/.../T/tmp.flGv1x44Y5\n```\n\nThe registered path is the same temp directory `install_node` creates at the\nproduction call site (`tmp=\"$(mktemp -d)\"; TMPFILES+=(\"$tmp\")`). After\n`fail()` / EXIT, the directory is gone.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add `TMPFILES` + `cleanup_tmpfiles` + EXIT trap\n- Register Node install temp dir and pnpm workspace rewrite temp file\n- Parent-shell registration (not command-substitution helpers)\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\n- **Behavior or issue addressed:** install-cli leaked mktemp dirs on fail after Node staging began\n- **Real environment tested:** macOS 15, bash 5.3, branch fix/install-cli-tmpfile-cleanup, real scripts/install-cli.sh\n- **Exact steps or command run after this patch:** source installer with NO_RUN; force install_node download path; fail inside download_file after TMPFILES registration; assert path cleaned\n- **Evidence after fix:** terminal output above from production install_node path (AFTER_RESULT=CLEANED)\n- **Observed result after fix:** EXIT trap removes the install_node staging directory when fail() runs mid-download\n- **What was not tested:** live Node tarball download shasum mismatch on CI network; pnpm workspace rewrite fail path (same TMPFILES mechanism)\n\n## Related\n\n- ClawSweeper P1: forced failure in patched installer production path\n- Pattern shared with scripts/install.sh\n",
        "branch": "fix/install-cli-tmpfile-cleanup",
